This repository holds the source code and creative assets for the HexaFalls
Techfest project (the "Project"), maintained by HexaFalls / GDG on Campus ·
JIS University (the "Maintainers").

The Project uses a split licensing model — inspired by the way the Linux
kernel organises its licensing. The full text of every license referenced
below lives in the `LICENSES/` directory. This file is the preamble that tells
you which terms apply to what.

